cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the toolkit version and the original clock publication. Preserve the
  fixture version, implementation ID, and provenance report with analyses.
title: Aging Clock Conformance
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - name: Aging Clock Conformance contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/jdj333/aging-clock-conformance
url: https://github.com/jdj333/aging-clock-conformance
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Local research infrastructure for validating biological aging-clock inputs,
  making explicit applicability decisions, and checking implementations against
  independently generated reference fixtures. Third-party scientific materials
  retain their separate licenses as documented in NOTICE.md.
keywords:
  - aging clocks
  - conformance
  - reproducibility
  - DNA methylation
references:
